# PayResolve AI — Frontend Environment Variables
# Copy this file to frontend/.env and fill in real values.
# IMPORTANT: Vite reads frontend/.env, NOT the root .env file.
# Variables starting with VITE_ are inlined into the browser bundle — never put
# backend secrets or passwords here.

# AG Studio free trial or enterprise license key (optional).
# Without it the Operations page shows a license notice; all other pages work normally.
# Never commit a real key; add it to frontend/.env locally and to the Render dashboard.
VITE_AG_LICENSE=your_ag_studio_license_key

# API base URL — leave empty (or comment out) when running against the local Vite dev server,
# because the vite.config.ts proxy forwards /api/* to http://127.0.0.1:8080.
# On Render, also leave empty: the Render rewrite rule proxies /api/* to the API service.
# Only set this if you are serving the frontend from a separate origin without a rewrite proxy.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
